WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.896
Today's words use four more sounds. Here they are.

2
00:00:03.346 --> 00:00:10.158
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:14.539 --> 00:00:16.604
The last two letters make the same sound.

4
00:00:17.054 --> 00:00:23.884
Point to each tile on the page and ask for its sound. If your child does not know one, tell them once, and move on.

5
00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.678
Then they read the words. Here are two of them.

6
00:00:30.074 --> 00:00:31.129
The word is dog.

7
00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:35.743
The word is cat.

8
00:00:36.643 --> 00:00:39.833
Last, your child matches four of the words to their pictures.
